{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】黃大仙下邨龍和樓有單位起火。</p>\n<p>其中一名女住戶懷疑吸入濃煙不適，在地下大堂戴上氧氣罩。傍晚6時許，龍和樓高層一個單位冒煙起火，消防派出一隊煙帽隊，開動一條喉，約20分鐘救熄，約100名居民自行疏散，起火原因有待調查。</p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T12:40:45.042105+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T12:11:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T12:34:42.738617+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T12:34:42.738617+00:00","content_hash":"6e2447ee216b1110f1d13ba842348e8fc626fe342cc424105f3c45bbb1a047ce","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}